# error-key-missing-value-after-comment

## Input

```
key # comment
next 1

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..21
  ENTRY@0..14
    WORD_KEY@0..3
      WORD@0..3 "key"
    SPACE@3..4 " "
    COMMENT@4..13 "# comment"
    NEWLINE@13..14 "\n"
  ENTRY@14..21
    WORD_KEY@14..18
      WORD@14..18 "next"
    SPACE@18..19 " "
    INTEGER@19..20
      NUMERAL@19..20 "1"
    NEWLINE@20..21 "\n"
```

## Syntax Error

```
[
    SyntaxError {
        message: "missing value for the key",
        range: 4..4,
    },
]
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..3 "key",
            },
            value: none,
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@14..18 "next",
            },
            value: Integer {
                sign: none,
                numeral: NUMERAL@19..20 "1",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

